# Play test of Varuna Point Remade (CIPlay varuna_point_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# landing on the north-east sand shelf, the ramp up to the site (10 m), the floodlight tower's deck (16.3 m), the four
# crates on the reef (2 to 7 m down), the deep under the point (11.6 m down).
island Varuna Point Remade
expect step 0
expect title Floodlight Down

# From the landing up the ramp to the construction site: the foreman's log on his desk by the office steps
walk 44 20 to 40 16 to 38 14 to 32.8 10 to 25 4 to 16 -1 h=10
zone site
expect step 0
read Foreman's log
expect step 1

# The floodlight's four parts from the crates round the point
at 40 28.5 h=-2
open Lens crate
at 24 28.5 h=-2
open Bulb crate
expect step 2
at 71 -10.5 h=-2
open Reflector crate
at 16 -28.5 h=-3
open Cable crate
expect story part 4
expect step 3

# Up the floodlight tower's ladder to its deck; the floodlight lit again
climb 17.5 -1.6 h=10
zone lightdeck
expect step 4
use floodlight
expect message hums
expect story part 0

# The deep under the point: the giant angler, and the foreman's strongbox it guarded
at 12 26 h=-8
zone deep
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
open Foreman's strongbox
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_WindTurbine 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricGrill 1
expect done
